               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[MAIN] Development of client-facing web applications and internal APIâ€™</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Helped develop and maintain a Key Variable Loader application using C#/.NET, Xamarin, MvvmCross, Android and SQLite, including cryptography and security-related functionality. Added unit and acceptance tests with MSTest and SpecFlow and supported Jenkins-based CI.</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Intern</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Software Development Intern â€” Motorola Solutions</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Jul 2018 â€“ Sep 2018</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Jul 2018 â€“ Sep 2018</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[LEFT DATE] July 2019 - Present</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Oct 2021 - Mar 2026</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[MAIN] Development of client-facing web applications and internal APIâ€™</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Developed and maintained an internal group-level web portal using C#, ASP.NET Core MVC and Angular. Delivered full-stack functionality with JavaScript, SCSS, Entity Framework Core and SQL Server for CYNK, an internal newsletter platform. </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[MAIN BOLD] .NET SOFTWARE ENGINEER AT STONEX</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Junior C#/.NET Developer â€” ABB </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Oct 2018 â€“ Jun 2019</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Oct 2018 â€“ Jun 2019</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[LEFT DATE] July 2019 - Present</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Oct 2021 - Mar 2026</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[MAIN] Development of client-facing web applications and internal APIâ€™</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Developed client-facing applications and internal APIs supporting customer acquisition, onboarding and servicing workflows. Built RESTful services using C#, ASP.NET Core MVC and ASP.NET MVC alongside HTML, CSS, JavaScript and T-SQL. Developed automated unit and integration tests using MSTest, NUnit, FluentAssertions, SpecFlow and WireMock, supported by TeamCity CI. Technologies: C# Â· ASP.NET Core MVC Â· ASP.NET MVC Â· JavaScript Â· T-SQL Â· ActiveMQ Â· MSTest Â· NUnit Â· FluentAssertions Â· SpecFlow Â· TeamCity </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[MAIN BOLD] .NET SOFTWARE ENGINEER AT STONEX</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Software Engineer â€” StoneX Group </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Jul 2019 â€“ Sep 2021</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Jul 2019 â€“ Sep 2021</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[LEFT DATE] July 2019 - Present</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Oct 2021 - Mar 2026</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[MAIN] Development of client-facing web applications and internal APIâ€™</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Developed Equiniti Help &amp; Support, a React SPA for UK customers, and contributed to Equiniti.com backend development using Umbraco 7, ASP.NET MVC and C#/.NET. Built a .NET REST API gateway for a non-RESTful knowledge-management service, with Swagger, xUnit and WireMock tests. Created Azure DevOps CI/CD pipelines and supported environment-specific Azure App Service configuration and deployment slots. Established Cypress end-to-end testing from the ground up, building coverage for key user flows, and added New Relic backend logging and synthetic monitoring. Technologies: React Â· JavaScript Â· C#/.NET Â· ASP.NET MVC Â· Umbraco 7 Â· Azure Â· Azure DevOps Â· Cypress Â· WireMock Â· xUnit Â· Swagger Â· New Relic Â· Sass/SCSS </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[MAIN BOLD] .NET SOFTWARE ENGINEER AT STONEX</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Full-Stack Developer â€” Endava </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>Oct 2021 â€“ Dec 2022</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Oct 2021 â€“ Dec 2022</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[LEFT DATE] July 2019 - Present</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Oct 2021 - Mar 2026</photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[MAIN] Development of client-facing web applications and internal APIâ€™</photoshop:LayerName>
                  <photoshop:LayerText>Built the React architecture and API integration for InTouch from scratch, simplifying implementation and mentoring two junior front-end developers. Led front-end development for TAIA, modernising the inherited React architecture, resolving major issues and improving performance. Coordinated delivery and mentored a junior developer. Delivered business functionality for ShareOwner Online, introduced Cypress component testing, integrated an updated design system and established MkDocs-based developer documentation. Developed reusable components for an internal Material UI-based design system, improving consistency across multiple products. Technologies: React Â· TypeScript Â· Vite Â· Tailwind CSS Â· Material UI Â· C#/.NET Â· Azure Â· Terraform Â· Cypress Â· xUnit Â· WireMock  </photoshop:LayerText>
               </rdf:li>
               <rdf:li rdf:parseType="Resource">
                  <photoshop:LayerName>[MAIN BOLD] .NET SOFTWARE ENGINEER AT STONEX</photoshop:LayerName>
